# Prose reassembly and math extraction

Steps 1 and 2 of the prose pipeline (SPEC.md §6.2): reassemble the docs spans into
HTML, then lift math runs out into placeholders. The ordering is the whole point —
quoted code is escaped first, then math is extracted before any HTML parsing, so a
less-than sign inside a formula is never read as a malformed tag.

The module is the extracted-math type, the prose error, the escaper, step 1
(reassembly), the helpers that mark skip regions and find delimiters, step 2
(extraction), the step-6 substitution, and the tests.
